## RBAC Configuration

A simulated multi-team environment was designed as follows:

| Team            | Resource Group        | Role        |
| --------------- | --------------------- | ----------- |
| TeamA           | rg-webapp-prod-eastus | Contributor |
| TeamB           | rg-webapp-dev-eastus  | Contributor |
| Operations Team | All Resource Groups   | Reader      |

### Rationale

* TeamA requires full management rights for production resources.
* TeamB requires full management rights for development resources.
* Operations Team requires read-only access for monitoring and auditing purposes.

Due to the use of a single Azure Free Trial account, the RBAC structure was documented rather than implemented with multiple Azure users.
